1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,880
Your text to Voyager 1

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,189
would take a whole day

3
00:00:03,189 --> 00:00:04,467
to arrive.

4
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,040
It's not ignoring you...

5
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,967
even LIGHT takes that long.

6
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:09,252
It zips past the Moon

7
00:00:09,252 --> 00:00:10,590
in one second...

8
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:12,733
Pluto in five hours...

9
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:14,340
and Voyager?

10
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,478
TOMORROW.

11
00:00:15,648 --> 00:00:16,840
And its reply?

12
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,267
Another whole day.

13
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:19,550
Beep.

14
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:21,791
Forty-nine years to get this far...

15
00:00:21,791 --> 00:00:23,450
and the nearest star

16
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:26,333
is fifteen hundred times farther.

17
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:28,100
Better hit send now!

